 not the same as cluster headaches, the presence of this symptom in conjunction with a patient's reported headache pattern may warrant further evaluation and management.\n\nIt is essential to refer to the most current clinical guidelines and relevant medical literature for a comprehensive understanding and management of cluster headaches.\n\nNote: The provided context does not contain specific guidelines for the management of cluster headaches. Clinicians should refer to updated guidelines and evidence-based practices to formulate an appropriate treatment plan for patients with cluster headaches.	2026-06-06 22:39:35.000441
