anges to further reduce his blood pressure and BMI.\n\n\nContext:\n--- Fragmento 1 (Fonte: 2023 AHA-ACC-ACCP-ASPC-NLA-PCNA Guideline for the Management of Patients With Chronic Coronary Disease: A Report of the American Heart Association - American College of Cardiology Joint Committee on Clinical Practice Guidelines.pdf, Pág: 13) ---\n[95% CI, −22.6 to −1	2026-06-07 11:14:59.924195
