ion about smoking cessation is crucial to address her overall health and potentially improve her diabetes management. While the other options are also important considerations in the management of diabetes, the patient's smoking habit presents an immediate risk that can be addressed and potentially mitigated with targeted intervention.\n\n\n-----\n\nQuestion  Medications:\n(A) Perform a fasting plasma glucose test\n(B) Discuss a smoking cessation program\n(C) Recommend a gl	2026-06-07 11:18:22.551772
